      "summary": {
        "text": "Valentin Hasse-Clot (born 27 February 1996) is a French racing driver who competes in the European Le Mans Series for Racing Spirit of Léman.\n\nHasse-Clot is a champion of the Silver class in both the GT4 European Series and French GT4 Cup in 2020 and 2021, respectively. In 2023, he won the GT3 title in the Le Mans Cup for Racing Spirit of Léman. As of 2026, Hasse-Clot is an Aston Martin Racing factory driver.",
